# The vendored copy of the shared client core is GENERATED
# (scripts/vendor-core.mjs) and is a byte-for-byte copy of the source files.
# Formatting it here would make every regeneration show up as drift, and the
# next `vendor` run would silently undo whatever the formatter did.
#
# scripts/export-store.mjs copies this file into the exported package, because
# the exported copy has the same vendored tree and the same reason.
src/vendor/
dist/

# Written by Raycast's own toolchain from the manifest: every `ray build` and
